                en: {
                    title:                  `L&D Goes Strategic`,
                    subtitle:               `You are the brand-new Chief Learning Officer of a €680M French industrial-tech group. The CFO has tabled a €1.4M cut to your €4.2M budget. You have one budget cycle to prove L&D moves a business number — or accept the cut and stay a cost center. The services transition is worth ≈ €11M in margin; the capability to deliver it does not yet exist.`,
                    header_tag:             `June 2026 · Lumière Industrielle SA · Lyon · the new CLO’s first board cycle`,
