                    r2_spend_label:         `Program spend this cycle, against the €4.2M budget (€M)`,
                    r2_spend_readout:       `Program spend:`,
                    r2_spend_m:             `M`,
                    r2_spend_hint:          `A classroom-for-everyone design blows the budget and burns selling days; a smart 70-20-10 blend delivers more behavior change for less. Going over €4.2M weakens the budget case.`,
                    mix_classroom:          `Mostly instructor-led — three days of classroom for all 1,400; it’s how serious training is done`,
